flowchart LR
  A[Optical GeoTIFF] --> V[Validate CRS/transform/bands]
  D[Source DEM] --> W[Validate units/NoData/CRS]
  V --> O[Check overlap]
  W --> O
  O --> R[Reproject/resample DEM to optical grid]
  R --> M[Preserve metric arrays and NoData]
  M --> N[Separate display normalization]
  N --> G[Texture + normals + UV + GLB]
  M --> T[Metric GeoTIFF + analysis grid]
  R --> E[Alignment report + hashes]

